{"t":"APLD","made":"2026-11-24 14:32","name":"Applied Digital Corporation","ko":"어플라이드디지털","sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","employees":256,"hq":"Dallas, TX, United States","website":"https://applieddigital.com","summary_en":"Applied Digital Corporation designs, develops, and operates digital infrastructure solutions to high-performance computing (HPC) and artificial intelligence industries in North America. It operates through: Data Center Hosting, and HPC Hosting Business. The company provides energized infrastructure services to crypto mining customers; and cloud services to customers, such as AI and machine learning developers. It also engages in the designing, constructing, and operating of data centers to provide computing power and support HPC applications. The company was formerly known as Applied Blockchain, Inc. and changed its name to Applied Digital Corporation in November 2022. Applied Digital Corporation is based in Dallas, Texas.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Applied Digital Corporation은 북미 지역의 고성능 컴퓨팅(HPC) 및 인공 지능 산업을 위한 디지털 인프라 솔루션을 설계, 개발 및 운영합니다. 데이터 센터 호스팅 및 HPC 호스팅 사업을 통해 운영됩니다. 회사는 암호화폐 채굴 고객에게 활력 있는 인프라 서비스를 제공합니다. AI 및 기계 학습 개발자와 같은 고객에게 클라우드 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한 컴퓨팅 성능을 제공하고 HPC 애플리케이션을 지원하기 위해 데이터 센터의 설계, 구축 및 운영에도 참여합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Applied Blockchain, Inc.로 알려졌으며 2022년 11월에 Applied Digital Corporation으로 이름을 변경했습니다. Applied Digital Corporation은 텍사스주 댈러스에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":13.82,"mcap":4178990080.0,"pe":null,"fpe":-17.617664,"peg":null,"ps":4.791035,"pb":2.562106,"ev_ebitda":-79.84,"div":0.0,"beta":5.535,"hi52":50.725,"lo52":11.31},"fin":{"rev":872252032.0,"rev_g":3.224,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.21646,"op":-0.26285,"net":-0.53033,"roe":-0.13623999,"fcf":-4283429632.0,"cash":2949908992.0,"debt":6483407872.0,"de":170.601,"eps":-1.62,"feps":-0.78444},"own":{"short":0.2242,"inst":0.71346,"insider":0.07743},"analyst":{"n":16,"mean":58.6875,"median":57.5,"high":93.0,"low":22.0,"rec":"strong_buy","recMean":